        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GodsArena</strong> is a dream project brought to life by our small independent team, inspired by the golden age of classic MMORPGs. Our mission was to recapture the spirit of true MMORPG gameplay, while adapting it to the pace of modern players who may not have 10+ hours a day to spare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/f2f52a3479af7bbec1e44bee787069a1.webp?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/f2f52a3479af7bbec1e44bee787069a1.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what is <i>GodsArena</i>? At its core, it features four unique classes — Mage, Warrior, Champion, and Priest — each with their own distinctive playstyle, abilities, and strengths. All classes are carefully balanced for thrilling PvP battles and efficient monster hunting across the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/98aae4fe3dd7c51fc12f96098b5d9455.apng?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/98aae4fe3dd7c51fc12f96098b5d9455.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your hero won’t be alone. Pets play a crucial role in battle — choose from dozens of companions, each with unique traits and skills. Pets grow stronger, level up, and learn new abilities, often turning the tide of combat. For collectors, there’s the option to own multiple pets and work toward a full collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/846d6ead2e8a123e191fdedd73a4e1bc.webp?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/846d6ead2e8a123e191fdedd73a4e1bc.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounts are also at your disposal — not just for faster travel across the expansive world, but also for enhancing your character’s stats. Mounts can be upgraded and equipped with special gear that directly boosts your performance in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>GodsArena</i> is inspired by ancient Greece and divided into two warring factions: Athens and Sparta. When creating a character, you’ll choose your allegiance and engage in an ongoing struggle for dominance and resources through large-scale PvP events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE enthusiasts will find a rich variety of instances and dungeons, offering both solo and group content with powerful bosses and valuable loot. Crafting and economic systems provide opportunities to gather resources, create useful items, and trade them on the in-game marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/8e89e53fde1d14f96a415a893174632f.apng?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/8e89e53fde1d14f96a415a893174632f.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who love character progression, <i>GodsArena</i> offers an extensive enhancement system. Unlike many other games, your gear doesn’t become obsolete as you level up — it can be upgraded and improved without losing any prior investment. You can also level up your skills, pets, mounts, and core attributes, making every character truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GodsArena</i> is constantly evolving, and even now offers:<br>• Over 50 maps for PvP and PvE battles<br>• Dozens of dungeons<br>• A wide range of events and seasonal content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us and become part of the legend in the world of <i>GodsArena</i>!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GodsArena</strong> is a dream project brought to life by our small independent team, inspired by the golden age of classic MMORPGs. Our mission was to recapture the spirit of true MMORPG gameplay, while adapting it to the pace of modern players who may not have 10+ hours a day to spare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/f2f52a3479af7bbec1e44bee787069a1.webp?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/f2f52a3479af7bbec1e44bee787069a1.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what is <i>GodsArena</i>? At its core, it features four unique classes — Mage, Warrior, Champion, and Priest — each with their own distinctive playstyle, abilities, and strengths. All classes are carefully balanced for thrilling PvP battles and efficient monster hunting across the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/98aae4fe3dd7c51fc12f96098b5d9455.apng?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/98aae4fe3dd7c51fc12f96098b5d9455.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your hero won’t be alone. Pets play a crucial role in battle — choose from dozens of companions, each with unique traits and skills. Pets grow stronger, level up, and learn new abilities, often turning the tide of combat. For collectors, there’s the option to own multiple pets and work toward a full collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/846d6ead2e8a123e191fdedd73a4e1bc.webp?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/846d6ead2e8a123e191fdedd73a4e1bc.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounts are also at your disposal — not just for faster travel across the expansive world, but also for enhancing your character’s stats. Mounts can be upgraded and equipped with special gear that directly boosts your performance in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>GodsArena</i> is inspired by ancient Greece and divided into two warring factions: Athens and Sparta. When creating a character, you’ll choose your allegiance and engage in an ongoing struggle for dominance and resources through large-scale PvP events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE enthusiasts will find a rich variety of instances and dungeons, offering both solo and group content with powerful bosses and valuable loot. Crafting and economic systems provide opportunities to gather resources, create useful items, and trade them on the in-game marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/8e89e53fde1d14f96a415a893174632f.apng?t=1785762245\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754990/extras/8e89e53fde1d14f96a415a893174632f.poster.avif?t=1785762245\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who love character progression, <i>GodsArena</i> offers an extensive enhancement system. Unlike many other games, your gear doesn’t become obsolete as you level up — it can be upgraded and improved without losing any prior investment. You can also level up your skills, pets, mounts, and core attributes, making every character truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GodsArena</i> is constantly evolving, and even now offers:<br>• Over 50 maps for PvP and PvE battles<br>• Dozens of dungeons<br>• A wide range of events and seasonal content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us and become part of the legend in the world of <i>GodsArena</i>!</p>",
        "short_description": "GodsArena is a dream game created by our small independent team inspired by classic MMORPGs. Four playable classes, a wide variety of pets, dungeons, maps, and of course — fierce rivals!",
